Upstream-Name: rockchip-vaapi
Upstream-Contact: defcom5-rockchip <defcom5-rockchip@users.noreply.github.com>
Source: https://github.com/defcom5-rockchip/rockchip-vaapi
Comment:
 This is the defcom5-rockchip fork of the rockchip-vaapi driver originally
 written by Eduardo García-Mádico Portabella. The fork adds HEVC and AV1
 decoding, correct 10-bit output and a number of decode-path fixes; the
 original author's work remains the foundation and is licensed unchanged.
 src/av1/ carries GStreamer's AV1 bit writer (Intel, LGPL-2.0+).

